@{
    ViewData["Title"] = "Privacy Policy";
}
<h1>@ViewData["Title"]</h1>

<p>Bevo's Tunes is a student project built for MIS 333K at UT Austin. It is not a real store: no payments are processed and no music is sold.</p>
<p>Account details, addresses, and card numbers you enter are stored only in the database this copy of the site is connected to, and are used only to demonstrate its features. Please don't enter real card numbers or sensitive personal information.</p>
